    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The main objective of this study is the development of a numerical simulator to study the transient drawdown and buildup behavior of a liquid in a gravity drainage well with a moving free surface boundary. The purpose of this work is  to provide a tool to help understanding the flow mechanism in the vicinity of the wellbore where the known methods of interpretation fail to determine the transient pressure behavior or to establish physical grounds for creating a method of interpretation of pumping gravity well tests.",
